{"ordinal":16067,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451838648324","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Ears_Gun_0860814","source":"Anger: Да ты, блять, больной на всю голову. А ну иди сюда, сука!","target":"Anger: Ești bolnav rău la cap, futu-i. Hai încoace, javră!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-401.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16068,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451838648323","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Ears_Gun_00cc9d0","source":"Anger: Ещё из-за ушей меня случайно застрелишь.","target":"Anger: O să mă împuști din greșeală și din cauza urechilor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-401.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16069,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451838648322","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Ears_Gun_099ea32","source":"Anger: Ты осторожнее своей бум-палкой маши.","target":"Anger: Ai grijă cum fluturi pușcociul ăla.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-401.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
