{"ordinal":16076,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451834454021","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Armpit_Gun_05f5608","source":"Anger: Когда расчёсываю до крови – зуд успокаивается.","target":"Anger: Când mă scarpin până la sânge, mâncărimea se potolește.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-401.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16077,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451834454020","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Armpit_Gun_09cc3db","source":"Anger: Оно чешется постоянно, будто провоцирует на что-то.","target":"Anger: Mă mănâncă tot timpul, de parcă mă împinge să fac ceva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-401.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
