{"ordinal":16093,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451826065415","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Photo_0dfede7","source":"Anger: Чё? Ты чё на меня так уставился? Чё ты там увидел?","target":"Anger: Ce? De ce te holbezi la mine? Ce-ai văzut acolo?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
