{"ordinal":16097,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451826065411","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Armpit_033d7d9","source":"Anger: Меня бесит, когда волосню под мышками оставляют, как будто ебучий кустарник там растить собрались.","target":"Anger: Mă scoate din minți când lasă părul la subraț, de parcă vor să crească un tufiș nenorocit acolo.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16098,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451826065410","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Armpit_09a3b41","source":"Anger: Да, брею.","target":"Anger: Da, mă rad.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16099,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451826065409","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Armpit_0f83332","source":"Anger: Вообще похуй.","target":"Anger: Mă doare-n cur.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
