{"ordinal":16101,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871114","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Eyes_0641e97","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16102,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871113","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Eyes_08a485b","source":"Anger: Что, цвет нравится? Голубые. Всегда такие были. Мне кроме них ничего и не надо было, чтобы девчонку склеить.","target":"Anger: Ce, îți place culoarea? Albaștri. Așa au fost mereu. N-aveam nevoie de nimic altceva ca să agăț o fată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16103,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871112","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Eyes_070bb2c","source":"Anger: Твои дела, но мне плевать.","target":"Anger: Treaba ta, mie nu-mi pasă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16104,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871111","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Hands_0e5fdc2","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
