{"ordinal":16106,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871109","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Hands_0261833","source":"Anger: Но тут нечего колоть, а злобу куда-то выплеснуть надо.","target":"Anger: Dar aici n-am ce despica, iar furia trebuie s-o vărs undeva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16107,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871108","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Hands_0fed2c2","source":"Anger: Ха. Бабушка в детстве говорила, что с такими руками мне дрова колоть, а не… заниматься тем, чем я занимался...","target":"Anger: Ha. Bunica îmi spunea când eram mic că, la ce mâini am, ar trebui să tai lemne, nu să... fac ce făceam eu...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16108,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871107","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Hands_0e6f074","source":"Anger: О, да, смотри, какие лапищи.","target":"Anger: O, da, uită-te ce labe am.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16109,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451821871106","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Anger_Hands_091cb31","source":"Anger: Да не вопрос.","target":"Anger: Sigur, nicio problemă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-402.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
